{'symbol': 'AES', 'date': '2021-10-15 08:00:00', 'title': 'AES ANNOUNCES QUARTERLY DIVIDEND', 'text': 'ARLINGTON, VA., OCT. 15, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0THE BOARD OF DIRECTORS OF THE AES CORPORATION (NYSE: AES) DECLARED A QUARTERLY COMMON STOCK DIVIDEND OF $0.1505 PER SHARE PAYABLE ON NOVEMBER 15, 2021 TO SHAREHOLDERS OF RECORD AT THE CLOSE OF BUSINESS ON NOVEMBER 2, 2021.'}